<title>HONG KONG: First Shanghai buys into baby goods firm.</title>
<headline>First Shanghai buys into baby goods firm.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Shanghai Investments Ltd said on Monday it would buy a 33.01 percent stake in China's Goodbaby Child Products Co Ltd, for US$6.9 million.</p>
<p>First Shanghai said it would buy the stake from Goodbaby Holdings Co, which had held 67 percent of the venture.</p>
<p>The other 33 percent belongs to China Assets (Holdings) Ltd.</p>
<p>Goodbaby manufactures products such as strollers, bicycles, clothing and beds.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
